191	/**
192	 * Resolve this workspace's stored, decrypted Apollo key (service-role read —
193	 * `secret` is withheld from `authenticated` by column grant, same pattern
194	 * /api/email/sync and Sillage use). Returns null when nothing is stored —
195	 * never accepts a raw key from the caller.
