 17	/**
 18	 * Agentic sourcing: one tool-calling loop that searches real platforms, scores
 19	 * real candidates (deterministic — see sourcing-tools.ts), and drafts outreach
 20	 * for the best matches, instead of the client stitching separate calls one at
 21	 * a time. TEXT + TOOL CALLS ONLY — like /api/hermes/chat, this never sends
